    "description": "Plumes of magenta and violet light and vapor shift and writhe out of a hole in reality surrounded by the fragments of a *runewell* suspended mid-explosion.",
    "disable": "DC 37 Arcana (master) or DC 40 Occultism (master) to redirect the magic back in on itself and cancel out the danger, or DC 40 Crafting (legendary) to reposition *runewell* fragments so they\u2019re not dangerous; three total successes are required to disable the shattered *runewell*",
    "hp": 90,
